# Giu build context nho. Data va output KHONG di vao image — chung duoc mount luc chay,
# xem compose.yaml. Ly do: data/ 341 MB co giay phep rieng, output/ 2,1 GB, va ca hai deu
# la thu phai doc duoc o trang thai that chu khong phai ban chup luc build.
data/
output/

.venv/
.git/
.github/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Tai lieu noi bo khong len GitHub thi cung khong vao image.
_noi-bo/

# Notebook PHAI co: tai lieu cong khai tro toi chung o nhieu cho, va
# tests/test_notebook_integrity.py doc truc tiep file .ipynb.

# Anh, video, slide neu co sau nay.
*.png
*.jpg
*.mp4
*.pdf

# Tru anh chup web app dung trong README: tests/test_documentation_integrity.py kiem
# moi link markdown, va trong container khong co .git nen khong the phan biet "vang mat
# vi .gitignore". Thieu file nay thi `docker compose run --rm tests` do.
!docs/assets/
